Z||000023||Fierochic88||06-22-2001||10:28 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by artherd:<BR><B>Jennifer, that's one more awesome car   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Thanks both for the pics, I really like the MOMO wheels, considering some for my car (soon as I can find them for not $too-much   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Really really dig the colour too, would love to see your collection (I've only 3 so far, and one northstar motor on the garage floor!)<P>Best!<BR>Ben.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hey there <BR>Welcome to the forum!  Where you from?  I was wondering what kind of wheels those were, I hadn't yanked them off to look at what is stamped on them yet (been to busy with my other cars' headliners).  Thanks for the info!<P>Jennifer<P>||||reg||1
