Z||000031||artherd||06-23-2001||04:35 AM||||Hi Jennifer!  Thanks for the warm welcome, I'm mostly a lurker here<P>I'm from Petaluma, CA (which is about 50miles north of San Francisco, good fiero wether here!)<P>It's been said, but the pics are great, love to hear more about the car, did you paint it? What's that colour ?? :P   (Can I have it? What's your favourite colour? lol)<P>The wheels you have (and I am considering for my 88  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> are made by MOMO Italy (www.momo.it) and are their "Sport" model.<P>You probally have 17x8" size (not many options in 5x100.)<P>The setup I am after is 17x7 in front, and 17x8.5 in back, but I don't think they actually make either wheel with quite those dimensions in 5x100 (oh sure, 5x112 no problem, heh!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P><BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Fierochic88:<BR><B> Hey there <BR>Welcome to the forum!  Where you from?  I was wondering what kind of wheels those were, I hadn't yanked them off to look at what is stamped on them yet (been to busy with my other cars' headliners).  Thanks for the info!<P>Jennifer<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>||||reg||3
Z||000032||artherd||06-23-2001||04:47 AM||||&lt;random excuse to test my sig&gt;<P>You know, it's funny. I never really liked the 85 GTs, but after seeing Jen's car, I'm head over heels!<P>I gotta find me one and do those colours, very classy.<P>&lt;/random excuse to test my sig&gt;<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
Z||000033||Fierochic88||06-23-2001||10:51 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><P>It's been said, but the pics are great, love to hear more about the car, did you paint it? What's that colour ?? :P   (Can I have it? What's your favourite colour? lol)<P>You probally have 17x8" size (not many options in 5x100.)<P> [/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hey there <BR>   Actually I didn't paint the car and I'm still trying to locate the exact color name.  The color of the car is what caught my eye along with the wheels.  Believe it or not I only paid $800 for it.  It does need some work but I'm looking forward to having it as a project.<BR>   The wheels are 16", but I'm not sure of the other dimensions.  I hope to pull them off to look at the dimensions but I have been tied up with my other Fieros lately.  <P>Jennifer||||reg||1
